---
title: "refund (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: refund(amount)
    q_check_paused --> q_check_period: not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: contract paused
    q_check_period --> q_check_position: block.timestamp in [endTime, refundEndTime]
    q_check_period --> q_revert_period: outside refund period
    q_check_position --> q_check_amount: investorPosition[investor].investedCapital > 0
    q_check_position --> q_revert_no_position: no invested capital
    q_check_amount --> q_update_position: amount <= investorPosition[investor].investedCapital
    q_check_amount --> q_revert_amount: insufficient position balance
    q_update_position --> q_update_total: investorPosition[investor].investedCapital -= amount
    q_update_total --> q_transfer: totalInvestedCapital -= amount
    q_transfer --> q_emit: bidToken.transfer(investor, amount)
    q_emit --> [*]: emit Refund(investor, amount)
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert ContractPaused
    q_revert_period --> [*]: revert OutsideRefundPeriod
    q_revert_no_position --> [*]: revert NoInvestedCapital
    q_revert_amount --> [*]: revert InsufficientPositionBalance

    note right of q_update_position
        INV-001: investorPosition[investor].investedCapital >= 0 after refund
        INV-002: totalInvestedCapital decreases by exactly amount
        INV-003: bidToken balance decreases by exactly amount
    end note
